sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Analyst UI
    participant API as FastAPI Service
    participant FS as File Storage
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant RS as Redis Status
    participant BG as Background Job

    U->>API: POST /assessments
    API->>FS: Save uploaded PDFs
    API->>DB: Insert assessment_version with status created
    API->>RS: Set phase to queued
    API-->>U: 202 Accepted with version_id
    API->>BG: Schedule background run
    BG->>RS: Set phase to indexing_documents
    BG->>DB: Persist documents and page chunks
    BG->>RS: Set phase to extracting_financials
    BG->>DB: Read indexed pages through tools
    BG->>RS: Set phase to enriching_and_scoring
    BG->>DB: Persist structured outputs
    BG->>RS: Set phase to writing_memo
    BG->>DB: Commit final results
    BG->>RS: Set phase to done
    U->>API: GET /status
    API-->>U: Current phase
    U->>API: GET /assessment
    API-->>U: Final assessment
